{"game": "the-first-descendant", "language": "english", "appid": 2074920, "month": "2024-12", "window": 3, "start_date": 1734307200, "end_date": 1734998399, "month_true_total": 1255, "quota": 8, "returned": 8, "pulled_at": "2026-10-01 15:47:15 UTC", "reviews": [{"recommendationid": "183517650", "author": {"steamid": "76561197998815506", "personaname": "Loden | Heathen", "persona_status": "online", "profile_url": "https://steamcommunity.com/id/Loden/", "num_games_owned": 0, "num_reviews": 81, "playtime_forever": 589, "playtime_last_two_weeks": 0, "playtime_at_review": 57, "last_played": 1768848754, "avatar": "c26286f1a292309692f9a3a04eed8e0b8c15c66b"}, "language": "english", "review": "The moment to moment game loop is fun\nThe art style is okay not bad just a bit generic IMO\n\nreally the only issue here is that its a F2P game, that means its design past that initial \"set the hook\" isn't there to be fun or engaging ... its there to piss you off, frustrate you and irritate you till you spend money.\n\nWhich fair they need money to exist, nothing is free but the F2P forces them to design a product that forces you to pay and worse as is always with F2P they quickly realize that getting 99.99% of players to pay ANYTHING is basically useless but you can get that last 0.01% to pay a crap ton and so the game's entire design ... past the \"set the hook\" is centred around that, make the whale happy, make the whale pump that credit card.\n\nIt is really a shame if they had any other monetization model and could thus actually focus on developing a fun and engaging product and not a whaling ship then this would be a real contender in the space ... they clearly have the talent but management is just to short-sighted to give it a chance instead its a whaling operation not for you (well) not for 99.99% of you so move on.\n\nAnd yes I have had a chance to play past the 1hr Steam reports but none of that matters plenty of other reviews here will tell you the same thing ... fun game on the surface, mared by predatory monetisation models that force the design to be a pain for most players.", "timestamp_created": 1734992712, "timestamp_updated": 1734992799, "voted_up": false, "votes_up": 1, "votes_funny": 0, "weighted_vote_score": 0.5, "comment_count": 0, "steam_purchase": true, "received_for_free": false, "refunded": false, "written_during_early_access": false, "primarily_steam_deck": false, "app_release_date": "1719730800", "reactions": []}, {"recommendationid": "183517543", "author": {"steamid": "76561199649965639", "personaname": "underfedman", "persona_status": "offline", "profile_url": "https://steamcommunity.com/profiles/76561199649965639/", "num_games_owned": 0, "num_reviews": 5, "playtime_forever": 595, "playtime_last_two_weeks": 0, "playtime_at_review": 480, "last_played": 1735319008, "avatar": "fef49e7fa7e1997310d705b2a6158ff8dc1cdfeb"}, "language": "english", "review": "scrumpdiddlyumptious", "timestamp_created": 1734992618, "timestamp_updated": 1734992618, "voted_up": true, "votes_up": 0, "votes_funny": 0, "weighted_vote_score": 0.5, "comment_count": 0, "steam_purchase": true, "received_for_free": false, "refunded": false, "written_during_early_access": false, "primarily_steam_deck": false, "app_release_date": "1719730800", "reactions": []}, {"recommendationid": "183514723", "author": {"steamid": "76561198811020960", "personaname": "沈黙の猫", "persona_status": "offline", "profile_url": "https://steamcommunity.com/id/iAowe/", "num_games_owned": 0, "num_reviews": 6, "playtime_forever": 44040, "playtime_last_two_weeks": 162, "playtime_at_review": 15767, "last_played": 1790499750, "avatar": "1191c81a57194f64acfcda94f0fd0cb94e92eff7"}, "language": "english", "review": "It's better than Destiny.", "timestamp_created": 1734990197, "timestamp_updated": 1744907138, "voted_up": true, "votes_up": 0, "votes_funny": 0, "weighted_vote_score": 0.5, "comment_count": 0, "steam_purchase": true, "received_for_free": false, "refunded": false, "written_d